  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YOUNGSTARS DEVT INITIATIVE (KNOSK SCHOOL) Establishment of ICT Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy is supporting KNOSK school with funding to undertake a project entitled: &#x2018;Establishment of ICT Center for the KNOSK N100/25Cents A-Day School, Kayarda Extension Layout, Kuje Abuja&#x2019; to provide safe and continuous access to education services for the students of the school.
The intervention will create access to ICT education for students of the school free from disruption by poverty and lack with the direct beneficiaries of this intervention coming from the 110+ students of the school, especially girls.</narrative>
  </description>
